  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Xim6pAY0\" id=\"h346b9f0-LhVCA0WA\">使用场景</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-qeVeU8Ro\">目前账户余额不足后，客户广告消耗投放不出去后，会造成损失</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-dhgqnOJV\" id=\"h346b9f0-oCnP0gWk\">解决思路</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-dshTkjvr\">通过创建一个定时的监控脚本，监控代理商账户下所有adv账户资金状态，若账户资金满足某个条件（如广告账户可用现金余额少于300元），则向企业IM群（如飞书群）发送通知</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-MqbPkTyM\">由于飞书群消息卡片长度限制，本示例代码仅会推送前50个触发余额判断条件的账户</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22javascript%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22692px%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%2F**%5Cn%20*%20%E7%9B%91%E6%8E%A7%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%95%86%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E4%B8%8B%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E8%B5%84%E9%87%91%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%EF%BC%8C%E8%8B%A5%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E8%B5%84%E9%87%91%E6%BB%A1%E8%B6%B3%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%AA%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E7%8E%B0%E9%87%91%E4%BD%99%E9%A2%9D%E5%B0%91%E4%BA%8E300%E5%85%83%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E5%90%91%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9AIM%E7%BE%A4%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E9%A3%9E%E4%B9%A6%E7%BE%A4%EF%BC%89%E5%8F%91%E9%80%81%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%5Cn%20*%2F%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%200.%20%E5%89%8D%E7%BD%AE%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%5Cnconst%20CONFIG%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20webHookURL%3A%20''%2C%20%2F%2F%20%E4%BE%9D%E7%85%A7%20https%3A%2F%2Fopen.feishu.cn%2Fdocument%2Fclient-docs%2Fbot-v3%2Fadd-custom-bot%20%E5%9C%A8%E9%A3%9E%E4%B9%A6%E7%BE%A4%E7%BB%84%E4%B8%AD%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%20webhook%20%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%EF%BC%8C%E5%A1%AB%E8%87%B3%E6%AD%A4%E5%A4%84%5Cn%20%20companyIDs%3A%20%5B%5D%2C%20%2F%2F%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E8%BF%87%E6%BB%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%EF%BC%8C%E4%B